          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows spend from the official Costs API. Only organization owners can create an Admin key; a read-only one is enough. [Create a key](https://platform.openai.com/settings/organization/admin-keys)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mostra o gasto pela Costs API oficial. Só proprietários da organização podem criar uma Admin key; uma somente leitura basta. [Criar uma chave](https://platform.openai.com/settings/organization/admin-keys)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sign in to the Cursor app to show usage." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Entre no app Cursor para mostrar o uso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some services have their own minimum: Cursor 1 min, Claude (OAuth) 2 min, OpenAI 10 min." : {
